<title>POLAND: Garment maker Lubawa up on Warsaw bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Garment maker Lubawa up on Warsaw bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish technical garment maker Zaklady Konfekcji Technicznej Lubawa SA started trading on the parallel floor of the Warsaw Stock Exchange at 18 zlotys, 5.9 percent above its public offering price of 17 zlotys.</p>
<p>Lubawa's initial public offering of 600,000 shares last August was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
